# Secrets. This repo holds no application code, but it is public and a stray
# dotenv file here would be as exposed as anywhere else. A bare `.env` line does
# not cover `.env.bak-*` or `.env.local`, and the rule belongs in the repo rather
# than in a machine-local global ignore file, which no clone or runner ever sees.
.env
.env.*

.DS_Store
